## Original Content
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) Small and Medium Enterprises (SME) Ministerial Meeting will be held on Sept. 4 in Guangzhou, south China's Guangdong Province, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT) said on Monday.

## Summary
The 32nd Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation Small and Medium Enterprises Ministerial Meeting is scheduled to be held on September 4, 2026, in Guangzhou, China. The meeting will focus on innovation and cooperation among SMEs in the Asia-Pacific region, as announced by China's Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.

## Key Points
- The meeting is the 32nd edition of APEC SME Ministerial Meeting.
- It will take place on September 4, 2026.
- The location is Guangzhou, Guangdong Province, China.
- The focus areas are innovation and cooperation.
- The announcement is made by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology (MIIT).


